\draw[dashed] (15,10) -- (10,10) node[midway,above,font=\small] {$5\text{ cm}$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
A triangular corner has been cut from a rectangle. What is the area of the figure that remains, in $\text{cm}^2$?

